      "body": "Enable AITER by default on ROCm by changing the default value of `VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER` from `False` to `True`.\r\n\r\nAITER unlocks the best performance on ROCm. Enabling it by default allows ROCm users to benefit from AITER without requiring additional environment configuration.",
