    {
      "body": "@AndreasKaratzas I am very much in favor of this.\r\n\r\nActually, I think we should deprecate this master switch in the future, and as many as possible `VLLM_ROCM_*` env vars as per https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/53938:\r\n\r\n> one useful step in this direction would be to switch AITER from using env vars for every feature to a config object similar to what e.g. --moe-backend and --quantization-config do today. \r\n\r\nrelying instead on vLLM backends abstractions.",
